1
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:30,600
Let me hold her for a bit.

2
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,560
The baby doesn't look like you.

3
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:35,119
More like Lu Yuan.

4
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:37,359
That's what everyone says.

5
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:39,880
Who was that on the phone just now?

6
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:43,079
A friend.

7
00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:44,920
Was it urgent?

8
00:00:45,359 --> 00:00:46,719
You look nervous.

9
00:00:48,359 --> 00:00:49,119
It's nothing.

10
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:52,159
Can you do me a favor?

11
00:00:54,520 --> 00:00:55,799
A light is out on the second floor.

12
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:02,479
Sure. Where is it?

13
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:06,040
In the second-floor hallway.

14
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:09,920
It's hard to work while holding her, right?

15
00:01:10,079 --> 00:01:11,159
I want to take her outside for some fresh air.

16
00:01:11,159 --> 00:01:12,200
She doesn't like the sun.

17
00:01:13,120 --> 00:01:13,799
Sunlight is good for the baby.

18
00:01:13,799 --> 00:01:14,799
I said there's no need.

19
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:20,920
Whatever you say.

20
00:01:36,799 --> 00:01:37,879
The toolbox is on the first floor.

21
00:02:12,879 --> 00:02:15,080
Are you sure the power's off?

22
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:17,159
Of course.

23
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,800
You don't think I'm trying to hurt you, do you?

24
00:02:23,439 --> 00:02:24,159
Of course not.

25
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:26,360
But I really did think about it.

26
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:34,439
But I've thought it through.

27
00:02:35,039 --> 00:02:36,319
If it's just a shock,

28
00:02:37,159 --> 00:02:38,599
it probably won't be fatal.

29
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:44,759
But falling from up here,

30
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:47,400
is a different story.

31
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:52,120
Are you kidding me?

32
00:02:52,159 --> 00:02:53,159
I'm not kidding.

33
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:55,319
Who the hell are you?

34
00:02:55,759 --> 00:02:56,680
What do you mean?

35
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,319
Why are you pretending to be the Nanny?

36
00:02:59,479 --> 00:03:00,439
This is a misunderstanding.

37
00:03:00,759 --> 00:03:01,240
Don't move!

38
00:03:07,159 --> 00:03:08,080
Just calm down.

39
00:03:09,759 --> 00:03:11,120
I know you're angry,

40
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:14,120
but you wouldn't hurt me, right?

41
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,840
I didn't mean to hurt you.

42
00:03:32,639 --> 00:03:33,919
It was just an accident.

43
00:03:51,639 --> 00:03:52,520
You're awake.

44
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,000
What do you want?

45
00:03:56,319 --> 00:03:58,199
I believe you're an actress now.

46
00:03:58,919 --> 00:03:59,879
What do you mean?

47
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:02,120
You've been acting all along, right?

48
00:04:06,479 --> 00:04:08,000
Can you tell me now

49
00:04:08,159 --> 00:04:09,479
who you really are?

50
00:04:10,039 --> 00:04:11,919
I never said I was the Nanny.

51
00:04:12,919 --> 00:04:14,199
You just assumed that on your own.

52
00:04:14,199 --> 00:04:15,759
But you never denied it.

53
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:18,240
The timing of your arrival

54
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:19,480
was a little too perfect.

55
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:22,319
Lu Yuan just said the Nanny was coming,

56
00:04:22,639 --> 00:04:23,519
and you showed up.

57
00:04:26,759 --> 00:04:28,439
You seem to have it all figured out.

58
00:04:32,639 --> 00:04:34,160
Lu Yuan was prepping for a project recently

59
00:04:34,759 --> 00:04:36,040
and staying on set.

60
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:38,800
And you're an actress.

61
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:39,920
Let me say it for you.

62
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:42,360
You think I'm his mistress.

63
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:43,399
Aren't you going to deny it?

64
00:04:43,439 --> 00:04:44,639
Would you believe me if I did?

65
00:04:44,639 --> 00:04:45,680
I don't trust anyone.

66
00:04:45,879 --> 00:04:46,920
I figured as much.

67
00:04:57,639 --> 00:04:58,839
What are you trying to do now?

68
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:00,800
That depends on

69
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:02,000
why you came here.

70
00:05:02,879 --> 00:05:03,800
What do you think?

71
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:06,319
I can only think of one possibility.

72
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:07,360
Let's hear it.

73
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:09,079
You want to replace me.

74
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:15,560
From the moment you walked in,

75
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:17,439
you've been imitating me.

76
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:19,560
The way you touch your hair,

77
00:05:20,319 --> 00:05:21,560
the tone of your voice.

78
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:26,120
You're sharper than I thought.

79
00:05:26,199 --> 00:05:27,920
You're dumber than I thought.

80
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:31,360
Do you really think Lu Yuan would like you?

81
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:34,120
A forty-year-old woman?

82
00:05:34,319 --> 00:05:35,439
Is he out of his mind?

83
00:05:39,319 --> 00:05:40,240
And what makes you think

84
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:41,600
he'd like who you are now?

85
00:05:42,439 --> 00:05:44,800
A volatile, irritable,

86
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:47,319
unfit mother and wife?

87
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:12,360
Who is it?

88
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:13,800
Hello.

89
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:15,879
I'm the Nanny Mr. Lu hired.

90
00:06:16,319 --> 00:06:17,639
You can just call me Ms. Liu.

91
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:19,920
I don't need a Nanny right now.

92
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:22,160
But he already paid.

93
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:24,000
Do you want to talk to him first?

94
00:06:24,680 --> 00:06:26,879
Fine. Wait here while I change.

95
00:06:27,439 --> 00:06:28,160
Okay.

96
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:45,279
Be gentle.

97
00:06:48,879 --> 00:06:50,000
Put Xiao Ran down.

98
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,720
She has nothing to do with this.

99
00:06:55,439 --> 00:06:56,319
Don't worry.

100
00:06:57,439 --> 00:06:58,720
I won't hurt her.

101
00:07:01,399 --> 00:07:03,360
I just want to play a game with you.

102
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:06,480
What?

103
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:14,279
Hello.

104
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:17,480
Hello, I'm Lu Yuan's wife.

105
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:20,079
Come in.

106
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:28,319
Have some water.

107
00:07:29,439 --> 00:07:30,279
Please don't trouble yourself.

108
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:32,120
With a slice of lemon.

109
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:34,480
Thank you.

110
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:52,160
Ma'am, is there anything you need me to do?

111
00:07:52,199 --> 00:07:53,360
Besides taking care of the baby,

112
00:07:53,399 --> 00:07:54,279
I can also do

113
00:07:54,279 --> 00:07:55,399
other household chores.

114
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:57,639
No need.

115
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:05,639
What's wrong, sweetie?

116
00:08:06,639 --> 00:08:08,360
Do you need a diaper change?

117
00:08:08,639 --> 00:08:09,800
Bring a new diaper.

118
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:11,360
Okay. Where are they?

119
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:12,560
No need. Let her get it.

120
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:13,399
She knows where they are.

121
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:15,680
Sweetie, Mommy's changing your diaper.

122
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:17,240
Here.

123
00:08:20,879 --> 00:08:22,199
That's a lot of pee.

124
00:08:24,319 --> 00:08:25,879
Let's wipe your little bottom.

125
00:08:26,639 --> 00:08:27,879
There, there, sweetie.

126
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:31,040
Such a good baby.

127
00:08:31,199 --> 00:08:32,799
Mommy changed it.

128
00:08:34,039 --> 00:08:35,879
You take such good care of the baby.

129
00:08:37,679 --> 00:08:39,000
Now do you believe me?

130
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:40,480
I really don't need a Nanny.

131
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:43,320
When Lu Yuan contacted you,

132
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:45,000
he must've said I had mental issues,

133
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:46,039
and that I'm emotionally unstable.

134
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:47,960
Especially when taking care of the baby.

135
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:51,480
He didn't say that.

136
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:52,840
If I had let you leave just now,

137
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:54,120
you would've definitely called him

138
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:55,399
and said I was acting strangely.

139
00:08:55,759 --> 00:08:57,360
So I wanted to show you

140
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:58,639
that I really am fine.

141
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:01,159
Plus, I have her helping me now.

142
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,559
You've thought of everything.

143
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:06,159
I'll have Lu Yuan

144
00:09:06,159 --> 00:09:07,559
pay your salary as usual.

145
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:10,279
Thank you, Ma'am.

146
00:09:10,879 --> 00:09:12,720
If there's nothing else,

147
00:09:12,759 --> 00:09:14,080
I'll be leaving now.

148
00:09:59,759 --> 00:10:00,679
What a pathetic flower.

149
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:02,240
It wilted in less than a day.

150
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:04,000
How did I do?

151
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:05,639
You're a great actress.

152
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:08,000
You shouldn't just be some nobody.

153
00:10:08,519 --> 00:10:09,480
Compared to you?

154
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:11,600
This game is pretty interesting.

155
00:10:12,159 --> 00:10:13,200
I accept your challenge.

156
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:18,480
You probably don't know

157
00:10:19,480 --> 00:10:20,799
that Lu Yuan has diabetes.

158
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:23,000
What are you trying to say?

159
00:10:23,639 --> 00:10:24,759
I've been on a diet lately,

160
00:10:25,360 --> 00:10:26,240
and I've been fasting.

161
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:28,639
This insulin works fast.

162
00:10:29,159 --> 00:10:29,919
Within a few minutes,

163
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:31,480
I'll pass out from low blood sugar.

164
00:10:31,759 --> 00:10:33,320
When that happens, you'll have two choices.

165
00:10:33,799 --> 00:10:34,399
First,

166
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:36,159
you can either watch me die.

167
00:10:36,720 --> 00:10:37,399
Second,

168
00:10:37,759 --> 00:10:39,039
you can call for help.

169
00:10:39,399 --> 00:10:40,399
But if you do,

170
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:42,840
Lu Yuan will see your true colors.

171
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:45,399
And you'll never get another chance.

172
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:54,039
You think that scares me?

173
00:10:55,879 --> 00:10:57,000
Then let's wait and see.

174
00:11:02,840 --> 00:11:04,080
And now,

175
00:11:04,759 --> 00:11:06,399
it's round two of the game.

176
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:08,399
Are you out of your mind?

177
00:11:18,639 --> 00:11:20,399
Don't they all say I'm crazy?

178
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:25,360
There's no point in doing this.

179
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:27,639
But seeing you panic

180
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,240
makes me quite happy.

181
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:37,480
Now I know

182
00:11:38,120 --> 00:11:39,399
why Lu Yuan likes you.

183
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:41,960
Why?

184
00:11:42,480 --> 00:11:43,759
Because you're more mature.

185
00:11:44,639 --> 00:11:45,600
More grounded.

186
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:47,399
In what way?

187
00:11:49,639 --> 00:11:51,240
To get what you want,

188
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:52,240
you stop at nothing.

189
00:11:53,120 --> 00:11:54,279
But you hide it better.

190
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:57,000
You're quite honest.

191
00:11:58,159 --> 00:11:59,080
But I know

192
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:03,279
what I really want right now.

193
00:12:03,759 --> 00:12:04,480
Like what?

194
00:12:05,879 --> 00:12:07,080
My true self.

195
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:11,399
Do you really know what you're saying?

196
00:12:14,759 --> 00:12:16,000
Your time is running out.

197
00:12:21,399 --> 00:12:22,080
Gao Shuqing.

198
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:25,000
Gao Shuqing.

199
00:12:28,399 --> 00:12:29,159
Gao Shuqing.

200
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:39,159
Wake up.

201
00:12:50,480 --> 00:12:52,200
Looks like I'm the better actress.

202
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:55,080
So...

203
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:57,080
The insulin was fake.

204
00:12:57,120 --> 00:12:58,159
Of course it was real.

205
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:00,279
How else could I fool you?

206
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:04,559
Very good. Very good.

207
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:05,600
You won the second round.

208
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:06,159
What's next?

209
00:13:06,159 --> 00:13:07,200
Round three?

210
00:13:10,639 --> 00:13:11,879
There's no round three.

211
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:22,879
What a shame.

212
00:13:23,159 --> 00:13:25,279
I thought we could finally settle this.

213
00:13:32,759 --> 00:13:33,639
Just leave.

214
00:13:34,519 --> 00:13:35,679
I don't want to deal with you.

215
00:13:37,519 --> 00:13:38,639
You know...

216
00:13:40,480 --> 00:13:41,399
I can't leave.

217
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:44,039
If you don't leave,

218
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:46,480
I'm calling the police.

219
00:13:48,279 --> 00:13:49,480
You've always known.

220
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:52,000
You just refuse to face it.

221
00:13:53,279 --> 00:13:54,639
Stop being cryptic.

222
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:08,120
What's wrong with you?

223
00:14:13,559 --> 00:14:15,159
You should be asking what you did.
